e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1976","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-oakland-raiders","name":"Oakland Raiders","code":"OAK","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 191)","str":85.4,"squad":[["Ken Stabler","QB",86],["Mike Rae","QB",64],["Mark Van Eeghen","RB",97],["Clarence Davis","RB",88],["Cliff Branch","WR",87],["Fred Biletnikoff","WR",86],["Mike Siani","WR",74],["Morris Bradshaw","WR",69],["Dave Casper","TE",99],["Warren Bankston","TE",54],["Art Shell","OL",99],["Dave Dalby","OL",99],["Gene Upshaw","OL",99],["George Buehler","OL",99],["Henry Lawrence","OL",73],["John Vella","OL",65],["Steve Sylvester","OL",59],["John Matuszak","DL",89],["Otis Sistrunk","DL",79],["Pat Toomay","DL",79],["Dave Rowe","DL",78],["Mike McCoy","DL",63],["Charles Philyaw","DL",59],["Ted Hendricks","LB",84],["Monte Johnson","LB",81],["Willie Hall","LB",81],["Willie Brown","CB",79],["Skip Thomas","CB",74],["Lester Hayes","CB",70],["Jimmy Warren","CB",58],["Jack Tatum","S",82],["George Atkinson","S",73],["Charles Phillips","S",69],["Errol Mann","K",99]]},{"id":"nfl-denver-broncos","name":"Denver Broncos","code":"DEN","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 103)","str":83.1,"squad":[["Craig Morton","QB",98],["Norris Weese","QB",66],["Otis Armstrong","RB",79],["Lonnie Perrin","RB",76],["Haven Moses","WR",84],["Jack Dolbin","WR",80],["Rick Upchurch","WR",72],["John Schultz","WR",61],["Riley Odoms","TE",83],["Ron Egloff"